WEBVTT

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.510
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.470
There's no time to think up a new bit.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.020
I've always dreamed of this day.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.480
With that bit I could even win...

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:05.910 --> 00:02:08.230
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:11.150
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.010
-<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>
-Stop singing my song.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.750
Don't steal my song.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:23.780
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.570
CHAPTER 40

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:32.540
THE FINAL BALLAD
SARA-KOZO

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.880
Hi! It's Poor Isamu's poor joke!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.010
They've stopped
my gas and power and water.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.640
Only my heart is left!

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.720
Yes! I'm poor, I'm poor!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.270
Now for my poor joke part two!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:58.740
They've built a huge house next door
so I tell my daughter that's ours too!

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.400
Yes! I'm poor, I'm poor!

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:09.000
Oh Sawa-chan! What a funny face!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.610
So ugly, it's cute!

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.840
It's no good. I'm bombing.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.140
Me too.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.100
Feels like it's been a lifetime's
worth of bombing.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:23.020
You're lucky.
You were actually a hit once.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.840
"Poor Isamu's Poor Comedy Skit."

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:28.220
That was long ago.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:31.300
Nobody remembers me now...

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.230
Hey, you!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:39.490
I've seen that face before!
You were on TV once!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.830
Oh! Are you Poor Isamu-san?

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.790
Uh... Yes.

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:47.740
Talk about nostalgic!

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.530
ALL JAPAN COMEDY GRAND PRIX
SECOND PLACE

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.630
Poor Isamu-san,
congratulations on second place!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.830
Thank you very much!

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.840
It's been 12 years...

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.840
That was the peak of my career.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:16.820
<i>...Pettakko</i>

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:20.900
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko
Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.310
What's that?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:28.540
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko
Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:31.540
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:37.300
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko
Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:42.310
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko
Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.660
A <i>yokai</i>?!

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.460
But...

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:50.170
that's a pretty catchy phrase.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.560
Get that down...

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.940
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko
Pettala petalako</i>

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.100
<i>Pettakko</i>

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:02.860
This is it!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:09.020
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko
Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:11.620
<i>Yay!</i>

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.750
<i>I went to all the food sample counters!
That's my free lunch today!</i>

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:17.050
<i>Okay!</i>

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:20.000
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:24.910
POOR ISAMU'S BIG COMEBACK!

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.090
What is this?

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.720
Mana said it's funny so I checked it out,

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.810
but it's totally boring.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.400
Dad, this song...

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.570
I've heard it before.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:40.110
Well, this is the Sara-Kozo's song.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.270
The Sara-Kozo?

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:46.500
It's the song the Sara-Kozo
has always loved to sing.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.060
This man must have heard it somewhere.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.280
This is bad!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.740
If this man is
singing without permission...

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:59.290
We have to do something, Kitaro.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:03.500
Go tell him to
stop singing this song right away!

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.800
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.080
-<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>
-Stop singing my song.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.190
You stole my song!

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:21.090
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.320
It seems that recently...

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:29.270
the humans are singing my song a lot.

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.530
This is...

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.200
my song!

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.210
SARA-KOZO

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.260
I-I didn't know!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:45.240
I was just imitating Poor Isamu's song!

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:50.390
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.100
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.350
<i>Pettakko</i>

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.600
You've been on fire recently, Isamu-chan!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.100
Yes! Thank you very much, Producer Date!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:05.610
This might even be better than
your Poor Comedy Skit.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:09.110
Yes! Thank you very much, Producer Date!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:13.560
Isamu-chan, keep on climbing to the top.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:18.190
Yes! Thank you very much, Producer Date!

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:22.360
I don't want to end as a one-hit wonder!

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.950
Poor Isamu-san.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:30.160
You've stolen a <i>yokai</i>'s song.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.310
That song is the <i>yokai</i> Sara-Kozo's.

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:36.560
You've stolen it.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.130
What...?

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.150
What are you talking about?

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:43.430
If you keep singing that song...

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:49.980
something terrible is bound to happen.

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:54.770
I-If you keep making wild accusations...

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:57.240
I'll call the cops!

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.650
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:09.050
<i>Something terrible is bound to happen.</i>

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.220
That's impossible.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.590
You're Poor Isamu!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:31.120
You stole my song, didn't you?!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.570
Th-That's not it!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:35.080
What's not it?! Tell me!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:39.830
I-I happened to hear this beautiful song
near the river one day.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.830
I-I was so taken by the beautiful voice
I couldn't help singing it.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:43.730
SECOND PLACE
MR. POOR ISAMU

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.130
I'm so sorry for
singing without permission!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:49.710
I swear I'll never sing it again!
Please forgive me!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:50.710
You mean that?!

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:51.710
I mean it!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:56.350
All right! You're off the hook this time.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.470
Th-Thank you very much.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:04.900
But that's my song!
Next time you sing it, you're a dead man!

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.640
O-Okay!

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:12.220
It's gone...

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.790
Honey, what's wrong?

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.300
Papa?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:22.290
Uh... I-It's nothing.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.820
What do I do?

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:25.820
I...

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.450
I've stolen...

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.670
a <i>yokai</i>'s song.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.040
A <i>yokai</i>?!

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:38.930
What?! What do you mean, Isamu-chan?

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.180
You don't want to do the Pettalako bit?

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.180
What'll you do now if not that?!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.320
Actually I've brought a new bit...

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.200
I don't want that.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:54.990
If you won't do that bit,
I can't put you on TV, Isamu-chan.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.190
What?!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.610
What can I do?

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.900
You seem to be troubled, sir.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.480
<i>YOKAI</i> CONSULTANT
BIBIBI NO RAT MAN

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.580
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:09.320
I hear you stole the Sara-Kozo's song.

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.090
How did you know?!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.310
The Sara-Kozo and I go way back.

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:20.350
I thought I could convince him
to let you use that song.

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.850
Y-Y-You can really do that?!

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.060
Of course!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.870
Well then...

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:29.510
The job will cost you this much.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.150
I-I'll pay it!

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.410
All I do is sweet talk the Sara-Kozo
and it's a job well done.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.790
Who are you?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.590
Well, well, Sara-Kozo-san.

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:51.910
Actually, I have
a bit of a proposal for you.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.680
<i>Pettala petalako pettakko</i>

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:57.300
He's still singing this song.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.470
I warned him.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:03.060
If he gets in trouble it's his own fault.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.130
It's not that simple, Kitaro.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:10.430
The Sara-Kozo can be quite difficult.

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.020
-No!
-Huh?!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:18.040
I'm not making any deals.
That song is mine alone.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:21.330
Jeez, what a stubborn grouch!

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:23.670
What's so great about that lame song?

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:24.820
Hey!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:30.200
Did you just say, "that lame song"?

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:35.540
The Sara-Kozo may seem docile at first.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:41.050
But it's actually quite hostile
and hard to control once angered.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:47.340
That Isamu bastard!
He thinks he can lie to me?!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.600
I swear... I won't forgive him!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.610
SARA-KOZO

00:11:56.380 --> 00:12:00.110
GANGI-KOZO

00:11:58.130 --> 00:11:59.010
-<i>"I was sleeping."</i>
-<i>"Sorry."</i>

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.010
<i>"Smack!"</i>

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:02.990
NEW MESSAGE

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:08.750
"Congratulations, Poor Isamu-sama."

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.260
"You're in the finals
of the All Japan Comedy Grand Prix..."

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:12.500
Hooray!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:15.620
It's been 12 years
since I was on that stage!

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:19.710
This time I'll win for sure!

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.710
Um... Mister Isamu?

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:27.600
Wh-What happened to you?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:30.220
About that job we discussed...

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.440
We managed to reach an agreement.

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:33.730
Really?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.820
Thank goodness!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:40.390
Right. I agreed that
I wouldn't forgive you.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.400
Help me!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:48.990
That comedian...

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.330
He's suddenly disappeared.

00:12:51.350 --> 00:12:53.350
<i>"I'm worried sick."</i>

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:55.460
His wife left a letter in
the Yokai Mailbox.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:58.030
My husband told me...

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:02.670
he'd stolen a <i>yokai</i>'s song.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.970
I'm guessing Isamu-san was...

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.590
kidnapped by the Sara-Kozo.

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.730
How could this happen?!

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.110
Shut up. Just wash!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:18.730
This is because you lied to me!

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:22.370
It's the Grand Prix finals today!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.700
Like I care.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:26.620
You're the one who stole a <i>yokai</i>'s song
in the first place.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.940
It was to feed my family.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.200
I had no choice.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.160
Get real.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:39.670
If you really cared for your family, you
would've quit being a comedian long ago.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.890
All you really care about is yourself.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:45.680
It doesn't matter
if your wife and kid are poor.

00:13:45.680 --> 00:13:50.100
You wanted to bathe in the spotlight
no matter what.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.840
That's the real you.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.650
Save my husband...

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:00.110
Please.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.680
Very well.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.530
But...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:07.480
He already ignored our warning.

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.110
If it's too late...

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:17.070
there's nothing we can do.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.830
We're done.

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:25.080
Sara-Kozo sensei, we've finished
our 10,000-plate quota.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:28.090
I see. You're a real help.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:30.130
Now then...

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.850
H-Hey! Hold it!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.350
What's going on?!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.150
I told you to wash 10,000 plates,

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.450
but I never said I'd forgive you
if you did.

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.110
B-But...!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.820
Dammit! You lied to us!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:48.350
Shut up! You think I'd forgive you
for making a fool of me?!

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:55.460
It's mud!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.360
It's a bottomless marsh!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:02.170
You can regret angering me
on your way to hell!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:03.540
But...!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:10.050
Don't you think that's enough?

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.310
Who are you?

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.970
Oh! Kitaro!

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:15.460
Stay out of my way!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:26.220
I'll show no mercy to
anyone who resists me!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:35.530
R-Remote Controlled Geta!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.580
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.080
Nice going, Kitaro!

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:50.370
H-H-H-Help us!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.860
Man, you really saved us, Kitaro-san.

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:57.980
Isamu-san.

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:58.770
Yes?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.270
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:06.270
I only rescued you because
your wife asked me to.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:12.190
