00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:17.450
I'm the Poverty god!
I'll take five percent of your wealth!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.030
Oh, thank goodness!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:21.380
That's less than the sales tax!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.150
That's no good!

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:27.510
I'll just have to do the Pettalako bit!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:29.630
